You are developing SynthFlow — an AI Agent & Visual Workflow Orchestration Engine strictly isolated inside `projects/synthflow-ai/`.

Constraints:
1. Keep all files, virtualenvs, node_modules, databases, and scripts strictly inside `projects/synthflow-ai/`.
2. Backend (`apps/api`): Python 3.11+, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.0 Async (SQLite aiosqlite default, PostgreSQL asyncpg compatible), Pydantic v2, httpx AsyncClient, sse-starlette, cryptography.fernet.
3. Frontend (`apps/web`): React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, @xyflow/react, Zustand, react-markdown, remark-gfm, lucide-react, i18next.
4. Support both zero-key realistic demo streaming mode and real OpenAI-compatible streaming APIs.
5. Encrypt all API keys with Fernet before persistence and only expose masked keys via API.
6. Enforce SSRF protection in HTTP Tool node execution.
7. Support bilingual UI (zh / en) and dark/light studio themes.
